DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:Deadline: PACT Zollverein: Residencies January to July 2027 (Essen\
 ; EUR 400 per week per person)
DESCRIPTION:PACT Zollverein\, the choreographic centre and arts venue on th
 e Zollverein World Heritage site in Essen\, hosts residencies for artists 
 and cultural professionals working in performing arts\, inter- and transdi
 sciplinary artistic practices\, film and moving image\, artistic practice 
 engaging with digital technologies\, and socially engaged arts. Residencie
 s are working periods without presentation obligation. WHAT YOU GET: a wee
 kly grant allowance of EUR 400 per project participant (up to 4 people)\, 
 studio space from 69 to 173 sqm (one studio barrier-free)\, local accommod
 ation for up to 4 people (barrier-free and family-friendly options by arra
 ngement)\, travel costs for one journey per participant to and from PACT (
 low-emission transport preferred)\, and technical equipment and profession
 al support by arrangement. WHO IS ELIGIBLE: professional artists and group
 s from anywhere in the world across the five fields above. DEADLINE: 28 Se
 ptember 2026\, 23:59 CET\, for residencies taking place January to July 20
 27\; decisions by the end of November 2026. TO APPLY: via the online form 
 on the PACT Zollverein website. Free to apply.\n\nOrganisation: PACT Zollv
 erein\nLocation: Essen\, Germany. Open to artists from all over the world.
 \nAward: Weekly grant allowance of EUR 400 per residency participant (max 
 4 people)\, plus studio space (69 to 173 sqm\, one barrier-free)\, local a
 ccommodation (max 4 people\; barrier-free and family-friendly by arrangeme
 nt)\, travel costs for one journey per participant to and from PACT\, and 
 technical equipment and professional support by arrangement. No applicatio
 n fee.\nDuration: 3 to 6 weeks (at a stretch) between January and July 202
 7\n\nMore: https://www.pact-zollverein.de/en/fields-of-work/artists-centre
 /residencies?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.pact-zollverein.de/en/fields-of-work/artists-centre/residen
 cies?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
